# Credential locations for existing integrations:
#   Stripe and Calendly: Admin page, Data/admin.json
#   Kit: Email page, Data/kit.json
#   OBS websocket: the existing OBS websocket configuration
#
# GPT Image uses environment variables already provided to the CareerOS process.
# The app does NOT load .env files. This file documents names only; no values.
# OPENAI_API_KEY       authorized OpenAI API project key; configure outside chat
# CAREEROS_GPT_IMAGE_MODEL optional supported model; default gpt-image-2
# See THUMBNAIL_GPT_SETUP.txt. No ChatGPT/Codex login token is used.
